<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF buys 15,000T of Indian rapeseed.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF buys 15,000T of Indian rapeseed.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) on Tuesday said it bought 15,000 tonnes of Indian rapeseed meal and 10,000 tonnes of Chinese cottonseed meal.</p>
<p>But the NLCF passed on tenders for 10,000 tonnes of ricebran, 10,000 tonnes of palm meal and 20,000 tonnes of copra due to high offer prices, said an NLCF official said.</p>
</text>
